      <div class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-10 border border-theme rounded-lg p-6">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-theme-primary mb-2">Pro Tip</h3>
        <p class="text-theme-secondary text-sm">
          Wire diameter is the most commonly shaved spec on field fence. Specify diameter with tolerance (±0.05 mm) and weight per 100 m on the purchase order, and verify with a micrometer and scale at delivery—a roll that is 5% light is netting the factory 5% of your steel money.
